Context-Aware Email Generation

Introduction:
This project aims to generate professional emails based on the user's needs and situations. 
The user can provide details such as the purpose of the email, who it is addressed to, the tone, and the required length. 
The system uses these details to create a suitable email. It helps users save time and makes email writing easier and more convenient.

Prompt:
Write an email based on the situation and instructions provided by the user.
Make sure the email follows the requested tone, word limit, and format. Keep the content clear, polite, 
and relevant to the given situation. Do not add any personal details or information that the user has not provided. 
If any important information is missing, use suitable placeholders instead of making assumptions. Generate only the email.

Sample Inputs and Expected Outputs
1. Input:

Write an email to my professor requesting an extension for submitting my assignment due to illness. Keep it polite and professional, within 50 words.
Subject: Request for Assignment Extension

Dear Professor,

I kindly request an extension for submitting my assignment as I have been unwell. Please consider my request and allow me some additional time.

Thank you for your understanding.

Best regards

2. Input:
Write an email to the HR department asking about the status of my job application. Keep it formal and short.
Subject: Job Application Status

Dear HR Team,

I would like to know the current status of my job application. Kindly provide an update when convenient.

Thank you for your time.

Best regards

